    "updated_at": "2024-07-08T09:15:34Z",
    "body": "My plan was to break all of those so that they would notice and update to the new algorithm, which will have new inputs and possibly be used quite differently (e.g. if we do the automatic handling of Web IDL callbacks). That feels a bit better than having them call the new algorithm with the wrong arguments silently...",
