    "body": "> Replied first to the more specific items. On muting (which is what the script plumbing is for), I'd hoped to avoid doing a ton of research into how that is implemented in all three major engines, at least as a prerequisite to this PR.\r\n\r\nAgreed; we should not block on that. The two paths I was offering in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/10404#pullrequestreview-2173619192 were just alternate ways of deferring the hard cases to the future.\r\n\r\nI'll open a new issue specifically about muting which we can link to and work on as a followup.",
